  "instance_name": "antisemitic_visual_juxtaposition",
  "label": "Antisemitic Visual Juxtaposition",
  "description": "The meme uses the visual juxtaposition of an ancient, culturally significant mosaic with the hateful text 'the floor is jews' to amplify the toxicity of the message. This technique leverages the historical and cultural weight of the mosaic to make the antisemitic message appear more credible or 'serious,' which is a common tactic in hate speech. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme's intent.",
